WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.800
They told us it would end 

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
That they'd starve

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.500
They lied...

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Everyday there's more of them 

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
And every attempt to clear their numbers has failed 

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Our old weapons are useless, 

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.000
they're weak.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:28.300
Hey Dude,

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.000
we're on our last porkchop

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.000
We gotta make a run for it 

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.000
There's a minecart that can get us out of here! 

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.500
That's suicide! 

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.500
Maybe,

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.000
but I've got an idea 

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.000
To the workbench!

00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:08.850
Look out! 

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:09.850
What? 

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:13.500
No! 

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.000
It's ok bro! 

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.000
when I said we were on our last porkchop,

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.000
I lied!

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:39.000
Subtitles by Valygard &amp; Me2Moo2

